<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>When The Day Is Done</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">When We Were Younger</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2L1F7gMujKPASRZ5MDAbr2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.522" end="00:04.138">Sitting round the table reminiscing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.138" end="00:09.914">About the same old stories that we have (all the time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.914" end="00:13.374">Used to cry until my momma</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.374" end="00:14.966">Had no choice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.966" end="00:20.571">Man, I used to be so good at that (so good, so good)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.571" end="00:23.748">Yeah, it took a while for me to see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.748" end="00:27.723">What I had in front of me was love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.723" end="00:29.223">And I'm living in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.074" end="00:30.677" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.677" end="00:33.063">Take me back to 01</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.063" end="00:35.722">Where life just begun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.722" end="00:39.693">If I could, I'll do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.693" end="00:41.193" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.494" end="00:42.619">I know that you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.619" end="00:47.340">No matter wherever I go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.340" end="00:51.078">So when the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.078" end="00:52.938">I'm coming home to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.938" end="00:55.336">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.336" end="00:59.579">I'm coming home to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.579" end="01:04.092" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.092" end="01:06.498">Damn, I can't believe that little boy used to be me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.498" end="01:11.012">That same dumb head, different state of mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.012" end="01:14.209">Guess it's safe to say that dad and I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.209" end="01:17.869">Share the same ol' smile and eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.869" end="01:20.783">Though he's had a bit more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.783" end="01:22.283" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.328" end="01:23.904">Take me back to 01</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.904" end="01:26.304">Where life just begun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.304" end="01:29.748">If I could, I'll do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.748" end="01:31.248" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.079" end="01:32.937">I know that you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.937" end="01:38.189">No matter wherever I go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.189" end="01:41.646">So when the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.646" end="01:44.998">I'm coming home to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.998" end="01:46.498">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.064" end="01:49.509">I'm coming home to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.509" end="01:51.009" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.317" end="01:53.238">Hours fly and years go by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.238" end="01:57.219">Cause time doesn't play by the rules</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.219" end="02:00.394">So when the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.394" end="02:03.326">I'm coming home to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.326" end="02:04.918">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.918" end="02:09.432">That's all I need to do (said)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.432" end="02:11.288" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.288" end="02:12.788">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.616" end="02:14.217">When the day is done (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.217" end="02:16.604">When the day is done (oh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.604" end="02:18.723">When the day is done (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.723" end="02:20.223" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.269" end="02:21.115">I know that you got me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.115" end="02:26.441">No matter wherever I go, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.441" end="02:29.122">So when the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.122" end="02:33.835">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.835" end="02:38.586">I'm coming home to you (coming back for you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.586" end="02:40.086" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.854" end="02:40.927">Hours fly and years go by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.927" end="02:45.182">Cause time doesn't play by the rules</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.182" end="02:47.047" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Time doesn't play by the rules)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.047" end="02:48.646">So when the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.646" end="02:51.859">I'm coming home to you (coming home)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.859" end="02:53.451">When the day is done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.451" end="02:57.451">That's all I need to do</p></div></body></tt>